      "hash64": "D2468F1286E8B1B4",
      "text": "Corin, estudiante de 3.º B.\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)], estudiante de intercambio.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_announcement_04",
      "hash64": "D2468E1286E8B001",
      "text": "La profesora Brie y compañía os esperan.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_announcement_05",
      "hash64": "D2468D1286E8AE4E",
      "text": "Presentaos en el aula de 1.º D a la mayor\\nbrevedad.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_system_02",
      "hash64": "B8D683F7C61615B5",
      "text": "♪¡Din, don, dan, don!♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "90B02286A38D8D66",
      "text": "¿De qué se tratará? Qué poco oportuno...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_dragonbb_14",
      "hash64": "41B7DB823CDF2300",
      "text": "Se han colado. ¡Que Cass ya no es el Campeón![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "90AD2586A38B5CA8",
      "text": "¡Levi, por favor! ¡Eso no está NADA bien![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_dragonbb_15",
      "hash64": "41B7DC823CDF24B3",
      "text": "Tratándose de Brie, más nos vale no hacernos de\\nrogar, que ya me la veo montándonos un pollo.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_dragonbb_16",
      "hash64": "41B7DD823CDF2666",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], tú ve yendo.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_dragonbb_18",
      "hash64": "41B7E7823CDF3764",
      "text": "Ya me encargo yo de que vaya Cass también,\\naunque tenga que llevarlo a cuestas.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_fairybb_11",
      "hash64": "90AD2686A38B5E5B",
      "text": "¡Mi más sincera enhorabuena de nuevo por tu\\nvictoria en el combate contra el Campeón!\\c\\nY mis disculpas por no poder celebrarlo como\\nes debido...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_dragonbb_17",
      "hash64": "41B7DE823CDF2819",
      "text": "Teníamos que ir al aula de 1.º D, ¿no?\\nTú ve yendo, colega. Ya nos vemos allí.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sdc02_0220_firebb_02",
      "hash64": "7086109444C1158E",
      "text": "Si me caigo del Alto Mando, no podré acceder\\nmás a ese rincón tan exclusivo de la Plaza Árida...\\c\\n¡Pues menuda gracia![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
